<?php declare(strict_types=1);require_once __DIR__.'/includes/ui.php';pv_page_start('About','',pv_is_logged_in());?><main class="nxt-document"><section class="pv-card pv-prose nxt-document-panel"><div class="nxt-document-head"><div><span class="pv-eyebrow">ABOUT THE PROJECT</span><h1>Digimon NXT</h1></div><?=nxt_sprite('veemon')?></div><p>Digimon NXT is a persistent 2D browser MMO set across the Dawn world. Tamers explore digital sectors, battle Digimon signatures, accumulate species-specific scan data, materialize persistent partners, field three active partners with three reserves and interact through shared multiplayer systems.</p><h2>Three versus three</h2><p>Command your partners in speed-ordered battles. Target an enemy, protect an ally, switch reserves and unleash team-wide skills. Every battle ends with full HP and SP restoration.</p><h2>Rival network</h2><p>Challenge real player teams and 1,000 persistent AI tamers in Battle Park. Follow real battle outcomes, partner development and head-to-head records in Tamer Activity and Tamer Rivals.</p><h2>Core loop</h2><p>Explore → encounter → battle → scan → materialize → train → trade → challenge the Battle Park. Wild battles never directly capture a Digimon.</p><h2>A world of connections</h2><p>Explore 264 Dawn locations at the supplied native image resolution. Use the atlas to find a destination, follow NXT travel gates, or choose another landing point to reach a separate platform. Meet other tamers and discover visible wild Digimon along the way.</p><h2>Every partner has a next chapter</h2><p>Explore a catalog of 1,000 forms, including rare Paradox variants. Train ABI and CAM, inherit moves and discover branching evolutions as your team grows.</p></section><section class="nxt-art-grid" aria-label="Digimon visual archive"><figure><img src="<?=pv_h(pv_asset('ui/partners.jpg'))?>" alt="Agumon and Gabumon pixel artwork" loading="lazy"><figcaption>PARTNER CONNECTION / COURAGE & FRIENDSHIP</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="<?=pv_h(pv_asset('ui/armor.jpg'))?>" alt="Veemon and armor Digimon pixel artwork" loading="lazy"><figcaption>NEXT EVOLUTION / LIMITLESS POTENTIAL</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="<?=pv_h(pv_asset('ui/rookies.png'))?>" alt="Digimon pixel portrait collection" loading="lazy"><figcaption>DIGITAL WORLD / NEW ENCOUNTERS</figcaption></figure></section></main><?php pv_page_end();?>
